***acceptance tests***

# listed-order-decides
Base mentions the undefined BaseMissing, Middle requires [Base] and mentions the undefined MiddleMissing, Top requires [Base, Middle]; listing the chain of Top raises `PlainSyntaxError` holding `Concept ⟨BaseMissing⟩ is not defined`.

# top-shape-before-requires
Top without `functional specs` requires the missing module Missing; parsing Top raises `MissingFunctionalitiesError`.

# top-shape-before-required-validation
Top without `functional specs` requires Base, whose functionality mentions the undefined BaseMissing; parsing Top raises `MissingFunctionalitiesError`.

# required-parse-error-before-top-concept-error
Base has the implementation req `- {% raw %}{% if %}{% endraw %}`; Top requires Base and mentions the undefined TopMissing; parsing Top raises `PlainSyntaxError` holding `Invalid Liquid`.

# top-concept-error-before-required-concept-error
Base mentions the undefined BaseMissing; Top requires Base and mentions the undefined TopMissing; parsing Top raises `PlainSyntaxError` holding `Concept ⟨TopMissing⟩ is not defined`.

# top-concept-error-before-required-shape-error
Base has no `functional specs`; Top requires Base and mentions the undefined TopMissing; parsing Top raises `PlainSyntaxError` holding `Concept ⟨TopMissing⟩ is not defined`.

# required-modules-top-down
Base mentions BaseMissing, Middle requires Base and mentions MiddleMissing, Top requires Middle; parsing Top raises `PlainSyntaxError` holding `Concept ⟨MiddleMissing⟩ is not defined`.

# required-module-without-functional-specs
Base has no `functional specs`; Top requires Base; parsing Top raises `MissingFunctionalitiesError` holding `Module 'Base'`.
